  "prefLabel": "Rev 1403.01 Payment In Lieu of Taxes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 1403.01 Payment In Lieu of Taxes. A utility shall be taxed under RSA 83-F, notwithstanding any payment in lieu of taxes agreement, except that any utility that has executed a payment in lieu of taxes agreement for a term authorized under former RSA 362-A:6 prior to April 1, 2006, the effective date of Chapter 294:5-9, Laws of 2006, shall not be subject to the tax.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev1400) #9841, eff 12-23-10; ss by #12706, eff 1-8-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rev1400.html"
